WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.967
Lab 2 moves to your own ServiceNow
Personal Developer Instance,

2
00:00:03.967 --> 00:00:06.850
never production, and the
authors haven't run it.

3
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:10.972
You build the finding table and the
scripted REST resource from the kit,

4
00:00:10.972 --> 00:00:15.513
lock it down with authentication and an
endpoint ACL for one integration user,

5
00:00:15.513 --> 00:00:18.237
then check a payload
locally before posting it.

6
00:00:18.237 --> 00:00:22.213
Expect a created record with
priority 2, due an hour later.

7
00:00:22.213 --> 00:00:24.650
Post it again and it de-duplicates.

8
00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:28.825
Post the typo and you get the same
four hundred Lab 1 predicted.

9
00:00:28.825 --> 00:00:30.100
Then back it all out.
